<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Forrestania turns to profit in half.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Forrestania turns to profit in half.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  3.15 vs   0.27</p>
<p>    Net profit			  1.76 vs loss 0.49</p>
<p>    Sales				32.44 vs 23.34</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Forrestania Gold NL is currently subject to a cash and scrip agreed takeover offer from Lionore Mining International Ltd of Canada.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
